  0.008,                                  !- Precool Design Humidity Ratio {kgWater/kgDryAir}
  12.7777777777778,                       !- Central Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature {C}
  16.6666666666667,                       !- Central Heating Design Supply Air Temperature {C}
