  1,                                      !- Heating Fraction of Autosized Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
  1,                                      !- Heating Fraction of Autosized Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
  3.1588213e-05,                          !- Heating Supply Air Flow Rate Per Unit Heating Capacity {m3/s-W}
